{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>前TVB男藝人、現年28歲的陳戩浩（Darryl），憑處境劇《愛．回家之開心速遞》飾演「氹仔」一角令人留下印象。繼去年向曾參選ViuTV《全民造星III》的女友梁詠祈（Winky）求婚成功後，二人於昨日（10月11日）正式拉埋天窗，攜手步入人生新階段！</p><figure><img alt=\"陳戩浩跪地求婚。（IG@zin_ho）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250805/1029475631697498112147329.jpeg/OA5mVlo-5K3PWhhKxmQH_GPdeR8X3l7m2uP8Ltrj_C4\"/><figcaption>陳戩浩跪地求婚。（IG@zin_ho）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"型男索女。（IG@zin_ho）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260727/1158403885543460864210657.jpeg/2UCJwxpw8emFI408IrKSvJaqYhMXwEKaLm6MnC5ujJw\"/><figcaption>型男索女。（IG@zin_ho）</figcaption></figure><p>「童話中的王子公主」手拖手合唱甜蜜爆燈</p><p>一對新人做足全套婚禮儀式，由早上的接新娘、去教堂溫馨行禮，到晚上舉辦盛大婚宴，全程甜絲絲兼「kiss不停」，幸福感滿瀉！在婚宴現場，新娘子梁詠祈戴上閃爍王冠，身穿白色長尾婚紗，氣質高雅；陳戩浩則帥氣登場，被現場賓客大讚造型如同「童話中的王子公主」。二人更在進場時手牽手合唱情歌《為妳鍾情》，隨後又甜蜜起舞，溫馨互動羨煞旁人。新娘子亦對婚禮照片感到十分滿意，感嘆：「呢度真係好靚，意外地影到咁浪漫嘅一幕！」</p><figure><img alt=\"陳戩浩28歲娶老婆，笑到好開心。（IG@l_winkyy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186432210677272576326158.png/lqW5zNt2jO8G6i_QiZ3XSESgKzSzbhXmXXhx7F14cew\"/><figcaption>陳戩浩28歲娶老婆，笑到好開心。（IG@l_winkyy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"兄弟們好幫得手！（IG@l_winkyy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186432429779324928649571.png/s3Ey1GF1X-5CD6TpMkjmj9UELmYd6kbrgGZVt4BmVbc\"/><figcaption>兄弟們好幫得手！（IG@l_winkyy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"兄弟們好幫得手！（IG@l_winkyy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186432432103100416568093.png/3ODhCwRCoczKWXAQRpKvK2h2Rid16gJgd4nqP3eJ6j8\"/><figcaption>兄弟們好幫得手！（IG@l_winkyy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"新娘子由爸爸引領入場。（IG@l_winkyy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186432058373705728958621.png/S6LnSX-MQYepvoY13rE866c1Rjysm9LSc8lk-HPJZPg\"/><figcaption>新娘子由爸爸引領入場。（IG@l_winkyy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一對新人宣讀誓詞後，情深一吻。（IG@l_winkyy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186432290037698560542908.png/N7hsrOMaEaRut50-TU3bO8H_m6BeHOY8bc5cGW3OXBk\"/><figcaption>一對新人宣讀誓詞後，情深一吻。（IG@l_winkyy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一對新人宣讀誓詞後，情深一吻。（IG@l_winkyy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186432292474720256417396.png/lQYUE8Z9wncAJG8n4ZXjbC6_VGGEYYs1U5F8sFORfLA\"/><figcaption>一對新人宣讀誓詞後，情深一吻。（IG@l_winkyy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"去到婚宴再錫。（IG@l_winkyy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186432060827504640142503.png/Jde4vEISA3ohHb_2bW9TI2YuD2NqmwzZ6l-4mupfuJo\"/><figcaption>去到婚宴再錫。（IG@l_winkyy）</figcaption></figure><p>敬酒環節金光閃閃　新娘掛滿龍鳳鈪金豬戴落頸</p><p>到了敬酒環節，新娘子換上一襲紅色晚裝裙，全身上下的金器首飾更成為全場焦點！除了戴滿手腕的厚重龍鳳金鈪外，還有象徵多子多福的金豬牌。由於收到親友贈送的金器數量甚多，手腕根本戴不完，最終要用紅繩將一對對龍鳳金鈪串起掛在頸上。新娘子全程笑容滿面、親切敬酒，充滿甜蜜氛圍。</p><figure><img alt=\"手牽手唱《為妳鍾情》進場。（IG@l_winkyy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186432583475531776645803.png/gW63_w9rQvo3r45f_3M4b_UJ-HSySCGld0TxzXdE8c0\"/><figcaption>手牽手唱《為妳鍾情》進場。（IG@l_winkyy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"十足童話中的王子與公主。（IG@l_winkyy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186432581172727808791268.png/ZAutWYuRaJzjQ8Kbr8pGz2n-pLd7OUKpQr-31UK_t9U\"/><figcaption>十足童話中的王子與公主。（IG@l_winkyy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"十足童話中的王子與公主。（IG@l_winkyy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186432734684254208953012.png/_ZqmgubXlPL87wwJhRwk9f5wOBUmdNrukhdXN5IXVzc\"/><figcaption>十足童話中的王子與公主。（IG@l_winkyy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"台上跳舞。（IG@l_winkyy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186432868637741056375981.png/HVVWY1s5UIENW08XQ1aefBX7UDeS5OuEa28O-WtvDvk\"/><figcaption>台上跳舞。（IG@l_winkyy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"台上跳舞。（IG@l_winkyy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186432880239710208254103.png/wpcOnm3fEal5KvBGjFrNp24wCF6az-x_LQ_b7S0P2-0\"/><figcaption>台上跳舞。（IG@l_winkyy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"台上跳舞。（IG@l_winkyy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186432878033375232642719.png/XWGyCxkdOwjg6Mx_nYv_Zvp7LiQmHOBo9j5rNfY-azU\"/><figcaption>台上跳舞。（IG@l_winkyy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好甜蜜浪漫。（IG@l_winkyy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186432871657639936234907.png/qsk-wTCXVnqVQhzdrefDmpaLuOg6mNwJr3AQN69wEDc\"/><figcaption>好甜蜜浪漫。（IG@l_winkyy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好甜蜜浪漫。（IG@l_winkyy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186432873817837568726189.png/g8h2XlTvanx7MsHxvpMGzXVNOdHGepqmUT2kZlE9pGY\"/><figcaption>好甜蜜浪漫。（IG@l_winkyy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好甜蜜浪漫。（IG@l_winkyy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186432875957063680709364.png/PWT32uckdTGjLC-mY8eROJmMdQ3PZE2_DTFUiw0xVIs\"/><figcaption>好甜蜜浪漫。（IG@l_winkyy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"新娘子滿頸金器。（IG@l_winkyy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186433345664323584634809.png/jH5jZ3HG1yQ3nWmQ83Dc0gPL0UEC7LVdcXcsQnF3LEI\"/><figcaption>新娘子滿頸金器。（IG@l_winkyy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"新娘子滿頸金器。（IG@l_winkyy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186433270209187840190243.png/_lb3OV1JwCaBIwE3t7hCZncLfJS4wGUDJprd5Saa3eU\"/><figcaption>新娘子滿頸金器。（IG@l_winkyy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"新娘子滿頸金器。（IG@l_winkyy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186433265662300160048917.png/XueuTvJqfY8puVfZ45ryYr_SoyFdZuKPc5AeOXOQHjk\"/><figcaption>新娘子滿頸金器。（IG@l_winkyy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"新娘子滿頸金器。（IG@l_winkyy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186433267776360448207961.png/DTv-foEtQK7kR5fnWabCYITmiKGEfvrCMMg4AjDIOAI\"/><figcaption>新娘子滿頸金器。（IG@l_winkyy）</figcaption></figure><p>9號風球過大禮</p><p>陳戩浩為2017年第29期TVB藝員訓練班學員，入行9年間曾參演《七公主》、《十八年後的終極告白》等劇集，並在今年3月宣布離巢。而新娘梁詠祈則曾參加《全民造星3》，二人雖出身自不同電視台，但感情始終如一。此前過大禮時雖然適逢9號風球襲港，但陳戩浩依然準備了花膠、魚翅、海參、勞力士名錶及紅寶石戒指等豐厚聘禮順利落訂。如今這對佳偶順利完婚，收穫了滿滿的祝福！</p><figure><img alt=\"陳戩浩落足本娶老婆。（IG@l_winkyy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260727/1158404250661818368983057.jpeg/FPrVkbgeKsTIOlsh8NXBrtXg6jjDd7vDSot4eEqLeHg\"/><figcaption>陳戩浩落足本娶老婆。（IG@l_winkyy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳戩浩最為觀眾熟悉的代表作，是在處境劇《愛．回家之開心速遞》中飾演澳門大學電影學會會長「氹仔」一角。（電視截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186433706055700480804392.png/8wuEQm6V1NvTDvTdKk4E5ayA7JR_LE3qm0LO25tCzts\"/><figcaption>陳戩浩最為觀眾熟悉的代表作，是在處境劇《愛．回家之開心速遞》中飾演澳門大學電影學會會長「氹仔」一角。（電視截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳戩浩擁有濃密眉毛和黑實膚色，曾被封「小劉青雲」。（資料圖片/陳順禎 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210908/512335351969353728174586.jpeg/ikBHNseFyWdOoTZzzX7YA9SW1EoiHWP-W7C4hGGwuIQ\"/><figcaption>陳戩浩擁有濃密眉毛和黑實膚色，曾被封「小劉青雲」。（資料圖片/陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳戩浩為2017年第29期TVB藝員訓練班學員，今年3月正式宣布離巢。（IG@zin_ho）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186433708522082304719456.png/nNwjiUFc3jIOsC8aSLoUVm3UBdI3b_E3s5a4xrOWuMY\"/><figcaption>陳戩浩為2017年第29期TVB藝員訓練班學員，今年3月正式宣布離巢。（IG@zin_ho）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T15:39:47.686022+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1356,"images":26,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T15:15:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T16:57:50.803797+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T15:37:43.607340+00:00","content_hash":"72aa1431c253cb54b0deed37ecd94d10bbf3bc6989ab199afb6909bb6d8b0d2b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}